# Death and retry at C3 (docs/NEXT_SLICE_BARROW.md 11 T4): lose to the Warden (the bot only guards), the death screen, RETRY:
# back at the waystone (the barrow, C3, byte for byte), full HP, and the boss intro runs at once in its short form (the
# retry goes from the death screen straight into its dialog); the
# second fight is won and the ending runs.
expect mode=title
newgame
until field
choose 0
talk wren
chase slime_a
chase slime_b
talk wren
talk brom
choose 0
talk brom
talk corwin
exit east
talk waystone
expect stage=5 cp=3 map=barrow
policy guard
goto 16 7
until death
until dialog
until to_battle
expect retries=1 stage=5 cp=3 map=barrow hp=30 at_cp=1 warden_down=0
policy boss:good:1
until title
expect mode=title cleared=1 warden_down=1 retries=1
